\pard\plain \ltrch\loch {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 What at night had been perfect and ideal was by day the more or less defective real. Cruelties, insults, ahd, he perceived, been inflicted on the aged erections, the condition of several moved him as he would have been moved by maimed sentient beings. They were wounded, broken, soughing off their outer shape in the deadly struggle against years, weather, and man.}
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 Track ran east and west for amny miles, and down almost to within living memory had been used for driving flocks and herds t ofairs and markets.}
